    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Major Updates:\u00a0Enhanced Core and Safety Systems (V 2.2.21.172)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Core Design</strong>: Operate a reactor with nine fuel blocks and 72 control rods for increased power output and complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Advanced Safety Features</strong>: Three-tier resistance banks, improved circulation pumps, and real-time monitoring panels for control rods and fuel blocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Operational Tasks App</strong>: Manage reactor functions remotely via your tablet, including fuel block loading/unloading and AO control.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Major Updates: Chemical Module (V 0.2.18.141)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boric Acid Management</strong>: Fine-tune reactor reactivity with boric acid dosing and filtration systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ion Exchange Columns</strong>: Maintain absorption capacity and prevent corrosion by managing coolant pH levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Xenon and Iodine Dynamics</strong>: Understand and control the effects of fission products like xenon-135 and iodine-135 on reactor stability.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Nuclear Reactor Simulator</strong>, where you step into the shoes of a nuclear power plant operator tasked with managing one of the most complex and dangerous systems on Earth. With the help of your AI-powered Operational Assistant (AO), you\u2019ll navigate the intricacies of reactor mechanics, balance energy production, and prevent catastrophic failures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428420/extras/a50ae359b9307dc87cc22b1457526975.avif?t=1750093798\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a deep, immersive simulation that challenges your strategic thinking, problem-solving skills, and ability to stay calm under pressure. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned simulation enthusiast or a curious newcomer, <strong>Nuclear Reactor Simulator</strong> offers a thrilling and educational experience like no other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Realistic Nuclear Reactor Operation</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control Every Aspect</strong>: Manage over 200 parameters and 150 switches across multiple reactor modules, including the Control Room, Containment Building, Turbine Building, and Cooling Towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Systems</strong>: Monitor and adjust reactor power, coolant flow, steam generation, and more to maintain optimal performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emergency Scenarios</strong>: Respond to unexpected events like equipment failures, floods, and fires with quick decision-making and precise actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428420/extras/77274830d5a23946c09b5957e296be8c.avif?t=1750093798\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AI-Powered Assistance</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Operational Assistant (AO)</strong>: Your AI companion helps with ignition protocols, alarm systems, and crisis management. Upgrade its skills to unlock advanced functionalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remote Control</strong>: Use your tablet to manage reactor tasks, control AO, and oversee operations from anywhere in the plant.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Complex and Rewarding Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daily Objectives</strong>: Meet energy production goals to earn Prestige and Experience Points. Level up to unlock more challenging scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Balance fuel consumption, maintenance costs, and community demands to keep your plant running efficiently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prestige System</strong>: Spend Prestige Points on upgrades, fuel blocks, protective gear, and even radioactive waste cleanup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428420/extras/71d168cc8e3302a5fa0f139c23dd99a4.avif?t=1750093798\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Advanced Reactor Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enhanced Core Design</strong>: Operate a state-of-the-art reactor with nine fuel blocks, 72 control rods, and advanced safety systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chemical Module</strong>: Dive into the chemistry of reactor operation with boric acid dosing, ion exchange filtration, and pH management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thermal and Steam Balance</strong>: Master the delicate equilibrium between steam generation, coolant flow, and energy output to avoid system failures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Realistic Soundtrack</strong>: Feel the tension and excitement of managing a nuclear power plant with an atmospheric soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Detailed Environments</strong>: Explore every corner of your plant, from the Control Room to the underground maintenance tunnels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428420/extras/3ab39d8af20a062a560a17c76ab66ba8.avif?t=1750093798\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What Makes This Game Unique?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nuclear Reactor Simulator</strong> stands out with its unparalleled depth and realism. Unlike other simulation games, it doesn\u2019t hold your hand with step-by-step tutorials. Instead, it empowers you to learn through experimentation, research, and community collaboration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Hand-Holding</strong>: Consult the in-game manual, research real-world reactor operations, or join the community to master the game\u2019s mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Constantly Evolving</strong>: Regular updates introduce new features, improve realism, and refine gameplay based on player feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Educational Value</strong>: Learn the science behind nuclear energy while having fun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love This Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrilling Challenges</strong>: Every decision matters. Will you prioritize power output or safety? Can you handle the pressure of an emergency?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: With dynamic systems, evolving challenges, and a community-driven learning curve, no two playthroughs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A True Simulator</strong>: This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a realistic, hands-on experience that will test your skills and keep you coming back for more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428420/extras/2ab39d20fd342c6534465b369a52ee45.avif?t=1750093798\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become part of a growing community of players who share tips, strategies, and stories of their reactor operations. Whether you\u2019re looking for advice or want to show off your achievements, there\u2019s a place for you in the <strong>Nuclear Reactor Simulator</strong> community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready to Take Control?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the Control Room, fire up the reactor, and see if you have what it takes to power the world\u2014or risk a meltdown. <strong>Nuclear Reactor Simulator</strong> is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428420/extras/71d950b3cbe3d09e4e8283909bce28a7.avif?t=1750093798\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
